<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Horana six-month net soars.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Horana six-month net soars.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the six months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  H1 1996	    H1 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		   252.91    vs     211.64</p>
<p>    Net profit		  39.37    vs	16.55</p>
<p>NOTE - Horana Plantations Ltd is one of six estate firms privatised in 1995. Company profits are not taxed in view of carried forward tax losses.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
